    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n20 Riverside is a one bedroom spacious apartment with private parking and is conveniently located just a few minutes' walk from Westport town centre. \n\nThe ground floor apartment has a floor area measuring approximately 55.6 square metres. Accommodation comprises of entrance hall, a generously sized open plan kitchen/dining/living room with a balcony overlooking the Carrowbeg River, one double bedroom with an en-suite and a large bathroom. The property is presented in excellent condition throughout and is ready for immediate occupation. \n\nExternally, each apartment has one assigned parking space which is accessed through electric gates. There is also a security gate giving pedestrian access to Westport's Mall River. The complex has a landscaped river walk along the Carrowbeg River with a number of seating areas.\n\nIt is rare for a property in such a convenient location, so close to Westport town centre, to come to the market. With easy access to the town's many amenities, this property is sure to appeal to a wide range of potential purchasers, whether looking to downsize, invest, or secure a convenient home close to everything Westport has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.2m x 1.03\nCarpeted\n\nHotpress - 0.8m x 0.8m\nShelved\n\nBathroom - 2.45m x 1.8m & 1.0m x 0.85\nFully tiled, jacuzzi bath, heated towel rail, wc, whb\n\nBedroom - 4.73m x 3.0\nCarpeted, built in wardrobe, blinds, curtains\n\nEn-Suite - 2.6m x 1.2m\nFully tiled, shower, heated towel rail, wc, whb\n\nKitchen/Living/Dining - 5.3m x 4.0m & 4.2m x 2.12m\nWide board pine floor in living area, amtico flooring in kitchen, beech shaker kitchen, integrated dishwasher, integrated fridge/freezer, integrated ceramic oven/hob, juliet balcony with river views.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Special Features & Services</li><li> Town centre location</li><li> Gated complex</li><li> Ground floor apartment </li><li> New energy efficient electric heaters</li><li> River views</ul>"
